        "description": "About the role  \nHelp build and grow a brand end to end. You'll research what works, shape the strategy, and turn ideas into campaigns, content, and designs that go live. This is a 30-day paid internship, and employment starts after it on successful completion. You'll work on real brand projects with direct mentorship from [founder / team lead].\n\nYou'll\n\n- Research competitors, audiences, and trends, and turn findings into brand and campaign ideas\n- Help shape brand positioning, messaging, and tone of voice\n- Plan and pitch campaigns and content across social media, web, and other channels\n- Design creatives that carry the brand consistently, such as posts, ads, and decks\n- Explain the marketing goal behind every idea and design\n- Experiment with AI and new creative tools\n\nYou should have\n\n- Good design sense, shown through a portfolio, Behance, Instagram, or college projects\n- Strong research skills and the ability to back ideas with insight\n- Original, creative thinking\n- Basic understanding of branding and marketing\n- Curiosity to learn new tools, including AI\n- Availability for the full 30 days and to continue full time if selected\n\nBonus\n\n- Canva, Figma, Photoshop, or video editing\n- Copywriting or content writing\n\nYou don't need to be strong at everything. Be great at some of it and eager to learn the rest.\n\nWhat you'll gain\n\n- Real brand and campaign experience, not practice tasks\n- Direct mentorship and weekly feedback\n- Exposure to AI-powered creative workflows\n- Internship certificate\n- Employment after the 30-day internship, based on performance and mutual fit\n\nDetails\n\n- Stipend: \u20b95,000-8,000 for the 30 days, based on skills and portfolio\n- Location / Work mode: [Ahmedabad, on-site]\n\nPay: Up to \u20b910,000.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\n\n- Flexible schedule\n- Paid sick time\n\nWork Location: In person",
